2."]},"controls":{"about":"The checker against broken kernels, n = 1000, workgroup size 64, 64 canary floats after the bound array in the same buffer. WGSL section 6.5.7 lets a store past the end of a binding write to any location of the bound buffer or not happen at all; the three oob modes are three of those allowed outcomes: discard (dropped), clamp (lands on the last element), buffer (lands at its own index in the canary words). caughtByOutput: the output check fails (a wrong element or a changed canary). caughtByCount: the emulator counts at least one store past the binding (only the emulator can count; a GPU run has only the output check).","rows":[{"kind":"add","oob":"discard","oobStores":0,"oobLoads":0,"mismatches":0,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":false,"caughtByCount":false},{"kind":"add","oob":"clamp","oobStores":0,"oobLoads":0,"mismatches":0,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":false,"caughtByCount":false},{"kind":"add","oob":"buffer","oobStores":0,"oobLoads":0,"mismatches":0,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":false,"caughtByCount":false},{"kind":"offByOne","oob":"discard","oobStores":1,"oobLoads":2,"mismatches":0,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":false,"caughtByCount":true},{"kind":"offByOne","oob":"clamp","oobStores":1,"oobLoads":2,"mismatches":1,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":true,"caughtByCount":true},{"kind":"offByOne","oob":"buffer","oobStores":1,"oobLoads":2,"mismatches":0,"canaryHit":1,"caughtByOutput":true,"caughtByCount":true},{"kind":"short","oob":"discard","oobStores":0,"oobLoads":0,"mismatches":1,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":true,"caughtByCount":false},{"kind":"short","oob":"clamp","oobStores":0,"oobLoads":0,"mismatches":1,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":true,"caughtByCount":false},{"kind":"short","oob":"buffer","oobStores":0,"oobLoads":0,"mismatches":1,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":true,"caughtByCount":false},{"kind":"noGuard","oob":"discard","oobStores":24,"oobLoads":48,"mismatches":0,"canaryHit":0,"caughtByOutput":false,"caughtByCount":true},{"kind":